== Power Sequence ==
Please note that sequential list does not mean that having some deeper steps rules out all previous. during diagnostics try go through whole sequence. As an example, PMU_CMK32K_SOC is not required untill T2 fully boots iBSS firmware from Socrom. Howeve it would prevent its SMC Firmware part to initiate further power sequence. 

